    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a 💛 below to affirm! Life feels like it’s moving so fast lately. One minute it was January, and what feels like a few weeks later, we’re already approaching June.\n\nI know a lot of us are still healing, still processing, still trying to rebuild routines and become softer with ourselves after everything we’ve carried this (and last) year.\n\nSo let this be your reminder to stop postponing joy, to stop waiting for everything to be perfect to enjoy yourself. You do not need to be “fully healed” or become some future, idealized version of yourself before you deserve happiness, love, community, softness, peace, or a beautiful new season.\n\nLet yourself enjoy your life while it’s happening.\n\nKeep going. Keep growing. Keep returning to yourself, over and over again. 🌷\n\nWritten by @williegreene_",
    "word_count": 136
  },
